## Conflict resolution

User intent, canon, causality, character knowledge, POV, and clarity remain hard constraints. Within those constraints, this reader-experience contract outranks generic craft preferences and optional ornament. Do not solve a plot problem by silently replacing the promised reading experience with another genre center.

## Source-isolation declaration

Do not infer missing behavior from a source title, author, source text, audit file, or model memory. Preserve the neutral experience coordinates above without reproducing source language, characters, worldbuilding, relationships, or event order.
